{"about_the_game":"<strong>Demo:  <br>- 10 levels available  <br>- 6 defense towers in total  <br>- Multiplayer mode with 2 maps</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686820/extras/1y.png?t=1749530581\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686820/extras/1.gif?t=1749530581\" /><br><strong>The game provides six basic elements: light, dark, fire, thunder, ice, and wind. Players can freely combine and match them to give defense towers unique abilities. Through reasonable element matching, activate powerful element bond effects, build your ultimate defense system, and let each tower play its maximum power!</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686820/extras/2y.png?t=1749530581\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686820/extras/2.gif?t=1749530581\" /><br><strong>Supports up to 4 people to work together online, plan defense formations with teammates, and cooperate to deal with the enemy's fierce attack. Combine your own element matching strategies, complement each other's advantages, defeat waves of enemies, and experience the fun of teamwork!</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686820/extras/3y.png?t=1749530581\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686820/extras/3.gif?t=1749530581\" /><br><strong>In the single-player campaign, each level will introduce unique enemies and new defense towers. By completing challenges, you can gradually unlock more powerful tower defense units. The campaign mode not only helps you familiarize yourself with the game operation, but also allows you to deeply master the essence of element matching and prepare for more difficult bat